# A Cool contest at Normal rank that takes first.
#
# contest-cool is the poffin-fed twin and placed second: cool=60 is
# seven visual hearts, one short of the Normal-rank bucket. This entry
# sets the five conditions and the sheen at the feeding cap, holds the
# matching scarf, and performs four Cool moves; the visual score is
# then eight hearts at every rank, and the acting round's type match
# is +10 rather than a miss. Winning is the only way to a ribbon.

name WINNER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 20481
money 3000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_TURTWIG
party SPECIES_ROSELIA 30 ITEM_RED_SCARF
party-move 0 0 MOVE_THUNDERBOLT
party-move 0 1 MOVE_THUNDER
party-move 0 2 MOVE_SWIFT
party-move 0 3 MOVE_AERIAL_ACE
condition 0 MON_DATA_COOL 255
condition 0 MON_DATA_BEAUTY 255
condition 0 MON_DATA_CUTE 255
condition 0 MON_DATA_SMART 255
condition 0 MON_DATA_TOUGH 255
condition 0 MON_DATA_SHEEN 255
map MAP_HEADER_HEARTHOME_CITY 0x1D1 0x2BA FACE_DOWN
